-- Hillsbrad Foothills restore from Ascension captures: the 60 Hillsbrad quests this server lacks (WDB questcache
-- captures up to 2026-09-05), their givers, credit and target NPCs (WDB creaturecache), the quest objects (WDB
-- gameobjectcache), their item drops, credits and spawns.
-- Positions follow the client QuestSuperTrack/SuperTrack points where one exists; every other spot, every facing
-- and respawn time, and every level, faction, NPC and unit flag of the new NPCs is estimated, since the captures
-- carry none. Type, family, rank, type flags, kill credits and health modifiers follow each creaturecache row; the
-- wardstones' family 218 and the Arcane Anomaly's family 324 do not exist in CreatureFamily.dbc and are 0.
-- Displays marked stand-in replace Ascension models the client lacks.

