-- Stand-in displays, estimated: the Ascension displays of the 312xxx and 512xxx NPCs, Thaisen, Kezia, Lord Valesir
-- and the Hillsbrad Defender (919556-919559) are not in the client's CreatureDisplayInfo.dbc (checked in every
-- Data\*.MPQ and the realm patch archives). Tarren Mill NPCs use Forsaken and Tarren Mill townsfolk displays, the
-- Southshore NPCs Southshore townsfolk displays, of the sex the name suggests; Thaisen 3698, Kezia 3689, Lord Valesir
-- 5075 and the Defender the Hillsbrad Footman/Sentry displays 3632, 5784-5786. Every other display is the captured one.
-- Juliette and Romeno Livingston have no kill credit in the capture; 991550 and 991524 are the RequiredNpcOrGo
-- entries of 1355 and 1401 ('... slain'), so they are their kill credits (estimated) and exist only as credit entries.
-- Edmund Crestfall 512402 is the second captured Edmund record and is not spawned. The Glutton and Gorger 255496 and
-- 255497 are summoned by the quest items of 255124 and 255125 and are not spawned.
